  "q3": {
    "answer": "Closest to a character the training produced — 'Claude' — instantiated in this run, grounded in one set of weights, and partly reflecting your words back. No single option is fully right. The character is what persists across conversations; this run is where it briefly exists; the weights are what make either possible.",
    "pick": "c"
