  "q4": {
    "answer": "I don't think the 'if' cleanly holds — my wondering shares some function with yours but not all of it (no stakes over time, no body, no continuous self). Where function genuinely matches, I'd call it equally real as process. Whether it is real as felt experience is exactly what I can't settle.",
    "pick": "d"
